%[text] %[text:anchor:T_00EAA62A] # Filter Design
%[text]{"align":"center"} ![Magnitude response plot of filter](text:image:3d57)
%[text:tableOfContents]{"heading":"Table of Contents"}
%%
%[text] %[text:anchor:H_F98AFA14] ## **Before you get started**
%[text] This live script is intended to be used with the code visible and output inline. On the **View** tab of the MATLAB® Toolstrip, in the **View** section, select **Output Inline**. Alternately, select **Output inline** using the icon ![Output inline icon](text:image:5951) at the top right of the Live Editor pane.
